# Formerly rejected:
# 2^(-3) = 1 / 8
# Exact reciprocal of a checked nonzero numeric base; no rounded values.
# Run: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/negative_integer_power_exact.lit
2^(-3) = 1 / 8
(-2)^(-3) = -1 / 8
(-2)^(-2) = 1 / 4
3^(-2) = 1 / 9
(2 / 3)^(-2) = 9 / 4
2^(-3) * 2^3 = 1
eval 3^(-1)
# eval displays 1 / 3 and stores no equality. Zero to a negative power rejects.
